message: "Please cite this research software and record the exact commit used."
type: software
title: "Satellite Repair Lab"
authors:
  - family-names: Aladdin
    given-names: Shawki
repository-code: "https://github.com/shawkialaddin/satellite-repair-lab"
url: "https://github.com/shawkialaddin/satellite-repair-lab"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Experimental infrastructure for studying offline vulnerability repair and
  independent patch acceptance in satellite-inspired applications. The initial
  pilot evaluates handwritten fixtures and synthetic mission timing; it does
  not demonstrate autonomous AI repair or flight readiness.
keywords:
  - automated program repair
  - patch validation
  - satellite cybersecurity
  - reproducibility
